    "root_cause": "The available ECR interface endpoints enabled private DNS for the VPC, so the GPU node resolved the standard ECR hostname to an endpoint ENI. The endpoint security group intentionally admitted TCP 443 only from itself for the Fargate probe; the GPU node was not an admitted source, and the DRA pull timed out.",
