      "The endpoints_ready receipt proves two interface endpoints were available with private DNS enabled.",
      "The same receipt proves endpoint ingress was a probe-exclusive self-reference on sg-0ca6899c4c72fb3a0.",
      "The DRA kubelet pull used the standard regional ECR hostname, resolved to private IP 172.31.26.108 and timed out on TCP 443.",
      "The DRA image was the first uncached Kubernetes image pulled after endpoint availability; no application manifest had been applied.",
      "Removing the endpoints during cleanup removed the VPC-wide private-DNS interception and every temporary endpoint resource."
    ],
    "scope_limit": "No claim is made that the endpoint policy would authorize the DRA repository. The network timeout occurred first; repository-policy coverage must be considered independently in any successor design.",
